I went to the railway station in the morning.
There was a huge crowd there.
First, I looked at the information board.
The train to Lonavala was on platform three.
I went there.
There was a large train there.
I asked a passenger, "Sir, does this train go to Lonavala?"
He said, "Yes, this train goes there."
I happily went inside the train.
I had a reserved ticket with me.
I looked for my own seat.
It was near the window.
I placed my own bag above.
Then I sat comfortably in my own seat.
A woman sat in front of me.
Her bag was large.
Therefore, she placed her own bag on the floor.
I looked outside the window.
After some time, the train departed.
